          "content": "Hi, I\u2019d like to book a one\u2011way flight from Chicago O\u2019Hare (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) for May\u202f26. I want the exact same flight I took on May\u202f10 (I don\u2019t have the flight number handy).  \n\nI\u2019ll be traveling in economy and would like an aisle seat for myself with a middle seat right next to it. I also want to add an extra passenger, Kevin\u202fSmith (DOB\u202f2001\u201104\u201112), and have the same seating arrangement for us.  \n\nI don\u2019t need any checked bags or travel insurance. I\u2019m willing to pay up to $500 total; if the price exceeds that, please book only my ticket and drop the second passenger.  \n\nI\u2019d like to pay using one of my certificates\u2014no other payment method, please.  \n\nMy name is Sophia\u202fSilva, and my user ID is\u202fsophia_silva_7557.",
